# The launch of a Structure gives no result (R22, item 3; plan M11 5b): the record that launches a Structure through a
# place holding a reference to it, in an operand position at the root -- answer 5.
# Plan M11 5v: the declaration of the ordinary Structure lives in the data part of main; the root holds the reference
# and the launch.
# The code of main is one unused place: a method with one parenthesized part and no code reads that part as its code.
sub: main () (
    S(int: k 1)
)
    int: unused 0
@: s main\data\S
int: r s()
